OL,3,GNEWSABrothers warned health trust days
OL,4,Abefore man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeless man died 10 days after his
OL,7,Fbrothers warned a mental health trust
OL,8,Fthat they feared his death unless
OL,9,Faction was taken to protect him.
OL,11,FBarney Spicer had spent much of his
OL,12,Fadult life suffering mental illness,
OL,13,Fand was discharged from a mental health
OL,14,Fhospital in Shrewsbury in November
OL,15,F2024, with with nowhere to live, an
OL,16,Finquest heard.
OL,18,FThe 45-year-old former chef died on 14
OL,19,FDecember, after a night out in Ludlow,
OL,20,Fof combined drug toxicity,
OL,21,Fbronchopneumonia, fatty liver disease
OL,22,Fand ischaemic heart disease.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
